00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:48.770
Lady, this sent me on a Google search.

419
00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:54.690
I became really curious about lifts in your shoes and how those work.

420
00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:56.430
Well, there's a lot in Hollywood.

421
00:20:56.810 --> 00:21:00.510
Well, that's why I got curious about it because I've heard that.

422
00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:04.070
I've heard that the male stars wear the lifts in their shoes.

423
00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:05.250
If they're a little shorter.

424
00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:05.810
Yeah.

425
00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:08.110
But I'm like, how does it work?

426
00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:13.290
Well, I guess that you can wear a regular shoe and it's just like how you imagine.

427
00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:19.150
There's like just a little wedge that you put inside the sole and then it bumps you up a little bit.

428
00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:26.870
Also, you might see some of your shorter male actors in a lot of cowboy boots because they have a little bit of a heel.

429
00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:29.050
That's a natural lift, right?

430
00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:30.990
Like just the shoe gives you a lift.

431
00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:31.270
Right.

432
00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:42.750
Well, I guess one of the problems with putting lifts in your shoes is that if you go more than, I mean, a half inch, then your heel pops out the back of your shoe.

433
00:21:42.930 --> 00:21:46.190
So you can actually like end up walking out of your shoes.

434
00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:58.390
So they invented something called elevator shoes that look like a regular shoe, but they're more like a woman's wedge, like a wedge heel.

435
00:21:58.650 --> 00:21:59.510
Oh, I'm sorry.

436
00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:04.210
Are you talking about a sneaker that might have a little heel built in?

437
00:22:04.310 --> 00:22:05.470
No, no.

