00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:12.290
No, that is not an elevator shoe because I can see that it has an exaggerated heel.

440
00:22:12.590 --> 00:22:13.750
Oh, it's sneaky.

441
00:22:14.110 --> 00:22:14.490
Yes.

442
00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:15.730
The elevator shoe.

443
00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:22.590
I watched a whole YouTube video on it by this guy who was reviewing the best elevator shoes.

444
00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:23.750
He was riveting.

445
00:22:23.990 --> 00:22:31.970
And yeah, it looks like a beautiful, I think it's even an Italian made leather businessman shoe.

446
00:22:33.030 --> 00:22:37.550
But on the inside, I don't know, it's like the way they designed it.

447
00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:41.290
It just looks like a shoe, but it makes you like two inches taller.

448
00:22:41.530 --> 00:22:42.190
That's a lot.

449
00:22:42.470 --> 00:22:42.830
It is.

450
00:22:43.370 --> 00:22:45.650
I would be like 5'3".

451
00:22:45.650 --> 00:22:46.390
I don't know.

452
00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:48.090
Maybe you need an elevator shoe.

453
00:22:48.410 --> 00:22:49.450
I have questions.

454
00:22:50.170 --> 00:22:51.410
What's it like to walk in them?

455
00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:52.950
Can you turn your ankle easily?

456
00:22:53.210 --> 00:22:54.610
No, it's easy to walk.

457
00:22:54.730 --> 00:23:01.110
According to the video, they're really comfortable and easy to walk in and actually better than putting a lift in your shoe.

458
00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:03.310
Because this forms around your foot.

459
00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.770
The lift, this guy was saying, is actually kind of dangerous because you can walk out of your shoe.

460
00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:09.790
You can twist your ankle.

461
00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:11.910
You're not actually getting good arch support.

462
00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:18.970
So gentlemen out there, if you're looking for a lift, I guess the elevator shoe is what you should look into.

463
00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:19.690
It's your way to go.

464
00:23:20.270 --> 00:23:26.830
Now, the lift, obviously, you can put in and out of different pairs of shoes, which I guess gives you variety.

465
00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:28.730
But I don't know.

466
00:23:28.730 --> 00:23:31.750
Well, Andy Bernard probably would love an elevator shoe.

467
00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:33.550
I think he would.

468
00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:35.730
But not for this character.

