496
00:24:50.650 --> 00:24:52.190
And so she's like, okay, okay.

497
00:24:52.190 --> 00:25:01.650
And there is a scene where I have to jump on the back of a security guard who's trying to, like, drag me off the set.

498
00:25:02.070 --> 00:25:09.390
And I really wanted to impress, you know, the director and, you know, and all this, one of my favorite shows.

499
00:25:09.550 --> 00:25:11.090
And so I really went crazy.

500
00:25:11.090 --> 00:25:17.330
And I, like, launched myself onto this gigantic gentleman like a cat, like a rabbit cat.

501
00:25:17.330 --> 00:25:26.610
And after the second take, the director ran out and he said, I don't want to step into your personal space.

502
00:25:26.610 --> 00:25:28.590
But the makeup artist has let me know you're pregnant.

503
00:25:28.770 --> 00:25:33.670
You might not want to throw yourself onto that man so violently.

504
00:25:35.350 --> 00:25:42.810
And so I did spend a couple of takes going, God, I hope I didn't knock that baby out of me.

505
00:25:42.890 --> 00:25:43.750
That would be a real shame.

506
00:25:44.510 --> 00:25:46.870
Maybe it would have been worth it for the show.

507
00:25:48.090 --> 00:25:49.050
Oh, Jessica.

508
00:25:49.490 --> 00:25:50.890
She is so funny to me.

509
00:25:50.930 --> 00:25:51.410
I know.

510
00:25:51.690 --> 00:25:55.350
I think she's one of those people that can just read the phone book and I'd be laughing.

511
00:25:55.610 --> 00:25:55.990
I know.

512
00:25:56.190 --> 00:25:57.190
Is that still an expression?

513
00:25:57.350 --> 00:25:58.570
People don't even say it anymore.

514
00:25:58.770 --> 00:26:00.950
Because we don't really get phone books anymore.

515
00:26:00.990 --> 00:26:03.990
Okay, insert read boring item and I'd still be laughing.

516
00:26:04.310 --> 00:26:09.950
Well, she also sent us in an audio clip just about her general takeaway from getting to do the show.

517
00:26:09.950 --> 00:26:11.150
And I want you to hear that, too.

518
00:26:11.730 --> 00:26:14.850
So I was so excited to be with Ed in a scene.

519
00:26:14.850 --> 00:26:19.670
Any time I get to be with someone from the UCB, it's very easy.

520
00:26:19.890 --> 00:26:23.470
It's like super easy lifting because you kind of know each other's rhythMs.

521
00:26:23.670 --> 00:26:28.270
And if somebody improvises, you're ready to improvise back with them.

522
00:26:28.750 --> 00:26:33.550
I can't remember if there were too many things that were actually improvised.

523
00:26:33.770 --> 00:26:38.610
They were short little scenes, but I'm sure there were little bits and bobs back and forth.

524
00:26:39.270 --> 00:26:44.070
One of the things I love about Ed is he's not only wildly funny, but he's quite charming.

525
00:26:44.170 --> 00:26:46.170
So I didn't have to act too hard.

526
00:26:46.390 --> 00:26:49.610
You know, he's a real gentleman and a scholar.

527
00:26:49.610 --> 00:26:53.830
So it was really fun to get to have like a little romantic moment with Ed.

528
00:26:55.870 --> 00:26:59.810
And I remember being very panicked that I had to sing.

529
00:27:00.070 --> 00:27:04.410
I do that strange like, but like, I'm not a singer.

530
00:27:04.630 --> 00:27:12.950
I mean, I'm pretty sure I was kicked out of my college acapella group, the Miss Chords,

531
00:27:12.950 --> 00:27:18.010
because instead of singing the harmony like I was supposed to, I would just sing the melody.

532
00:27:18.270 --> 00:27:20.610
And they finally, they were like, we're not hearing any alto.

533
00:27:20.910 --> 00:27:23.390
I'm like, and you never will, bitches, because I don't know how to do that.

534
00:27:23.550 --> 00:27:27.170
So I remember being a little nervous about singing.

535
00:27:27.430 --> 00:27:32.850
I just had to sort of go for it and hope that it wasn't too offensive to anybody's ears.

536
00:27:34.250 --> 00:27:35.590
She's so funny.

537
00:27:37.330 --> 00:27:40.290
Everything about that clip is so funny to me.

538
00:27:40.990 --> 00:27:45.990
If you guys want to hear more from Jessica, you have to listen to her podcast,

539
00:27:46.190 --> 00:27:48.790
The Deep Dive that she does with June, Diane, Raphael,

540
00:27:48.930 --> 00:27:54.470
or download her audio book, The Art of Small Talk that she did with Casey Wilson,

541
00:27:54.470 --> 00:27:56.630
because it's more of that.

