00:29:12.130 --> 00:29:14.870
Why is your bulls**t card about the size of the envelope?

575
00:29:15.130 --> 00:29:17.250
Because it's, like, laughable to me.

576
00:29:17.390 --> 00:29:22.030
It is a giant gray envelope, and then written in huge letters,

577
00:29:22.050 --> 00:29:24.390
it says, Jim, in Sharpie.

578
00:29:24.510 --> 00:29:26.590
It's like, Cameron, did you catch the envelope?

579
00:29:26.810 --> 00:29:27.870
Okay, let's make it bigger.

580
00:29:28.090 --> 00:29:31.210
It's, like, almost the size of, like, an iPad.

581
00:29:32.010 --> 00:29:32.470
Okay.

582
00:29:32.770 --> 00:29:35.250
The size of the envelope did not bother me in any way.

583
00:29:35.350 --> 00:29:37.870
It felt appropriate for a disc.

584
00:29:38.030 --> 00:29:39.910
So we're playing two bulls**t cards.

585
00:29:39.910 --> 00:29:40.890
I guess so.

586
00:29:41.290 --> 00:29:47.530
I mean, I just want to know how they got through all of this footage so quickly.

587
00:29:48.630 --> 00:29:50.350
I mean, impressive.

588
00:29:51.010 --> 00:29:51.670
Very impressive.

589
00:29:52.150 --> 00:29:55.750
Well, big envelope or not, Jim is very happy to have it.

590
00:29:56.110 --> 00:29:58.550
We're going to go back to the auditions.

591
00:29:58.590 --> 00:30:01.170
The last person is on stage.

592
00:30:01.350 --> 00:30:02.330
It's a young woman.

593
00:30:02.510 --> 00:30:04.150
Yes, she's very talented.

594
00:30:04.410 --> 00:30:06.750
She's singing Beautiful by Christina Aguilera,

595
00:30:06.750 --> 00:30:08.490
and it's going very well for her.

596
00:30:08.490 --> 00:30:11.810
So this gal who's singing, her name is Rachel Crow,

597
00:30:12.090 --> 00:30:19.550
and she was a contestant on the first season of The X Factor when she was 13 years old.

598
00:30:19.690 --> 00:30:20.930
I have an audio clip.

599
00:30:20.930 --> 00:30:43.020
I mean, that's amazing.

600
00:30:43.320 --> 00:30:44.860
She brought down the house.

601
00:30:45.280 --> 00:30:48.260
She went all the way to the quarterfinal round.

602
00:30:48.620 --> 00:30:52.800
And after that, she went on to star in the TV series Schooled.

