01:04:59.530 --> 01:05:02.970
There were a lot of babies at the family portrait studio.

1237
01:05:04.210 --> 01:05:05.770
Tell us what you think.

1238
01:05:07.130 --> 01:05:13.990
Well, I understand the fan mail flurry over this because it was set up that it might not

1239
01:05:13.990 --> 01:05:15.490
be Dwight's child, right?

1240
01:05:15.890 --> 01:05:16.930
Very clearly.

1241
