This is how I always made it make sense for me.

1242
01:05:21.770 --> 01:05:26.690
When Dwight takes the diaper, Angela doesn't know if he got Phillips or not.

1243
01:05:27.610 --> 01:05:28.770
She goes with them.

1244
01:05:28.930 --> 01:05:30.090
She's very invested.

1245
01:05:30.090 --> 01:05:33.210
This could end her marriage.

1246
01:05:33.470 --> 01:05:36.690
And although she loved Dwight, she thought it was over for them.

1247
01:05:37.610 --> 01:05:38.910
They had missed their moment.

1248
01:05:39.490 --> 01:05:44.090
And she had built this whole life with the state senator, for better or for worse.

1249
01:05:45.550 --> 01:05:48.550
So she sat there with him and waited for the results.

1250
01:05:48.750 --> 01:05:52.930
And they held hands because I think it was as big for her as it was for him.

1251
01:05:53.110 --> 01:05:56.370
She didn't know if he was going to find out the truth that she knew all along.

1252
01:05:57.110 --> 01:05:57.670
Okay.

1253
01:05:58.330 --> 01:06:02.930
And she didn't say anything because she wasn't ready to tell him.

1254
01:06:04.130 --> 01:06:11.390
And then when they said, it's not your child, she is relieved because now she can keep her

1255
01:06:11.390 --> 01:06:12.110
life intact.

1256
01:06:13.110 --> 01:06:15.710
And there's a lot of sadness for her as well.

1257
01:06:16.630 --> 01:06:24.030
But what you're saying is that, and you've said this before, that she never really consummated her

1258
01:06:24.030 --> 01:06:25.430
relationship with the senator.

1259
01:06:25.670 --> 01:06:29.350
The only person she was sexually active with was Dwight.

1260
01:06:29.510 --> 01:06:30.790
This was Dwight's baby.

1261
01:06:30.970 --> 01:06:31.430
Yes.

1262
01:06:31.430 --> 01:06:36.490
But somehow, something sort of serendipitously happened in the testings.

1263
01:06:36.750 --> 01:06:43.090
But somehow, something went wrong in the testing facility or maybe he grabbed the wrong diaper.

1264
01:06:43.350 --> 01:06:46.490
And that's why the test result said that.

1265
01:06:46.890 --> 01:06:48.730
I think he grabbed the wrong diaper.

1266
01:06:49.030 --> 01:06:49.370
Okay.

