01:06:52.230 --> 01:06:54.750
I think he grabbed the wrong diaper, but Angela couldn't be sure.

1270
01:06:54.910 --> 01:06:56.550
And that's why she followed him there.

1271
01:06:57.750 --> 01:07:02.470
And then I think there were many times she wanted to tell him, but she thought he had

1272
